{"page":163,"h":11508,"lines":[{"x":0.34679335580642462,"w":0.2826603233040153,"y":0.87053571419398945,"h":0.023359634573497545,"text":"St. Luke 17: 7-10","conf":1},{"w":0.20780925007609574,"text":"May 10, 1942","y":0.82375523363892023,"h":0.029815113733685172,"x":0.38659418759295672,"conf":1},{"x":0.10171931308792166,"text":"\"Will any one of you, who has a servant ploughing or keeping","conf":1,"y":0.78542497019637314,"w":0.78936396016703014,"h":0.027249424230484709},{"h":0.024167348468114414,"text":"sheep, say to him when he has come in from the field, 'Come at","conf":1,"x":0.073496672216749326,"y":0.76705218972096323,"w":0.81973187335125797},{"y":0.74691285500865068,"text":"once and sit down at table'? Will he not rather say to him,","x":0.075669590787312807,"w":0.81798201721984065,"conf":1,"h":0.030493241453927622},{"conf":1,"x":0.073224336629096998,"w":0.81779410622336646,"h":0.027159495959206192,"text":"'Prepare supper for me, and gird yourself and serve me, till I eat","y":0.72585067275996151},{"w":0.81514754852691262,"text":"and drink; and afterwards you shall eat and drink'? Does he","y":0.70833363133653204,"x":0.073432246705614268,"h":0.023459126078893333,"conf":1},{"h":0.019883868240174851,"text":"thank the servant because he did what was commanded? So","y":0.69148481853350474,"x":0.073489616973484384,"w":0.81741010987913443,"conf":1},{"w":0.81710211023107748,"text":"you also, when you have done all that is commanded you, say,","x":0.073634224852790503,"h":0.021871539335402201,"y":0.66860465136848046,"conf":1},{"text":"'We are unworthy servants; we have only done what was our","x":0.073634224852790503,"y":0.65104166674478647,"w":0.81710211023107748,"h":0.021923449304368736,"conf":1},{"x":0.073634205145395357,"w":0.10213776377888469,"conf":1,"y":0.6336805555830034,"h":0.01893572296415047,"text":"duty.' \""},{"y":0.59713288116285312,"conf":1,"x":0.075851695999177182,"h":0.020850516500927174,"text":"MATTHIAS CLAUDIUS once said: \"The words of Christ are","w":0.81504247095677762},{"conf":1,"y":0.57122115251273731,"x":0.071062430527381246,"w":0.81748333225002534,"h":0.023701849437895328,"text":"like a fountain which never dries up. When you draw from"},{"h":0.026287109132796971,"conf":1,"text":"this fountain of wisdom, it fills up again and the second","x":0.073392086100423512,"y":0.54688815085212661,"w":0.8151620146516082},{"text":"truth you derive is fuller and more splendid than the first.","conf":1,"y":0.52752976186075695,"h":0.020435354066273503,"w":0.81710211023107748,"x":0.073634224852790503},{"h":0.025819386754717177,"y":0.50255955306198707,"x":0.075714289834047446,"w":0.81532451084681912,"text":"Thus it is with all that proceeded from the mouth of Christ,","conf":1},{"text":"His sayings and His parables.\" May we prove the truth of","conf":1,"x":0.073634207837678489,"w":0.81947742808948876,"y":0.48255814004943975,"h":0.021906145981379965},{"h":0.020394979015229242,"conf":1,"y":0.4607558142473881,"text":"these words to-day!","x":0.071258912098578014,"w":0.27078383309500553},{"y":0.43459302319163917,"w":0.038004748232952967,"h":0.015988372621082103,"x":0.4536817115129772,"conf":1,"text":"I"},{"text":"Our parable is easily intelligible in itself. It illustrated the","conf":1,"x":0.10688836409704808,"y":0.39384920674153545,"w":0.78147268914557122,"h":0.020394979015229242},{"text":"relation existing between a master and his slave (for the","w":0.81710211023107771,"y":0.37202380962415282,"conf":1,"x":0.071258914718190611,"h":0.020418050743284621},{"y":0.34710431318273416,"h":0.023947466933538109,"w":0.81976556158685066,"x":0.068728619921087516,"text":"\"servant\" of the parable is a slave). The slave is the property","conf":1},{"y":0.32558139572164069,"x":0.073634209565470649,"w":0.81472684191418931,"h":0.020400747420295851,"conf":1,"text":"of his master, and stands wholly at the disposal of the latter."},{"w":0.81472684191418931,"x":0.073634210535383451,"y":0.30377907016793082,"text":"The master has unlimited right to his service. The slave has","conf":1,"h":0.02037767569224036},{"w":0.81710211023107748,"h":0.021825396825396859,"conf":1,"text":"no rights at all and is not in a position to raise any claims.","y":0.28050595200490935,"x":0.071258914100613344},{"h":0.021877306794363394,"text":"All that he does he is obliged to do, and he has no reason to","conf":1,"y":0.25719246022378417,"x":0.071258908160086662,"w":0.81472684191418943},{"conf":1,"text":"expect any thanks from his master.","y":0.23536706323510148,"w":0.49168643703708403,"x":0.071258924165543386,"h":0.020446889930301193},{"conf":1,"y":0.21220930264855087,"h":0.020429586607312311,"text":"In suggesting this, Jesus is not telling His hearers anything","x":0.10213777115000557,"w":0.78384795746245939},{"conf":1,"x":0.070981659653066576,"y":0.18751788144968462,"w":0.81522612138227968,"h":0.027580124045175181,"text":"new, nor does He propose to give them instruction about the"},{"conf":1,"w":0.81710211023107759,"h":0.020348836505223789,"y":0.16715116322579338,"x":0.068883630055821932,"text":"slave system. They already know all about it. Again, He does"},{"conf":1,"y":0.14533730175960613,"w":0.81710211023107759,"h":0.020360372369251589,"x":0.068883630055821932,"text":"not intend to make a judgment on slavery or to say whether"},{"y":0.12202380932034207,"x":0.066508323663094102,"conf":1,"text":"it is a worthy or an unworthy institution. He takes the","h":0.021871539335402312,"w":0.81947742808948865},{"text":"material basis of His parable from life and from the social","h":0.020441121525234585,"y":0.1001984129095479,"x":0.068883617410193762,"w":0.81710211023107737,"conf":1},{"y":0.074127907125295045,"conf":1,"w":0.047505936065277476,"text":"167","h":0.020348836505223789,"x":0.48693586849942777}],"w":7029}